<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Warner-Lambert raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Warner-Lambert raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Robert Uhl upgraded Warner-Lambert Co to strong buy from hold, with a price target of $90 in 12-to-18 months.</p>
<p>-- He cited likely first quarter 1997 introductions of the cholesterol-lowering drug, Lipitor, and the diabetes treatment, Rezulin. The launches would come &quot;sooner than we had expected,&quot; the analyst said in a report.</p>
<p>-- Warner-Lambert was up 1-1/4 to 75-7/8 in late morning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
